{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken to find yourself in complete darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Echo Maze&quot; is a completely new auditory exploration puzzle game that entirely eliminates visual information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing players can rely on is their own sense of hearing. You must accurately perceive the direction and distance of the various sounds you hear around you, drawing a map of the labyrinth in your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, not every sound will lead you to the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you cannot distinguish the danger hidden in the sounds, death may be just one step away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape from this labyrinth of sound with your sharpened hearing and concentration?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Gameplay with Zero Visuals:</strong> Immerse yourself in a pure auditory experience without relying on graphics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927440/extras/4a344b216679bcdca827f374465642aa.avif?t=1756546108\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigation by 3D Spatial Audio:</strong> Realistically sense the direction and distance of sound sources to pinpoint your location.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927440/extras/ece72f78b38be696a74412fcd66bcebe.avif?t=1756546108\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense and Immersive Soundscape:</strong> Sounds can be crucial hints or deadly traps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927440/extras/2a4e5fa591df4b4605b7833270ea89d5.avif?t=1756546108\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of Gimmicks to Test Your Hearing:</strong> This is not a simple maze; various traps await to test the player's ability to listen and distinguish sounds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a fully immersive experience, the use of headphones or earphones is strongly recommended.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927440?t=1756546108","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927440?t=1756546108","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927440/b1cc11639d3368f09ccc7aa08bb8de16119558af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756546108","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927440/b1cc11639d3368f09ccc7aa08bb8de16119558af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756546108","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken to find yourself in complete darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Echo Maze&quot; is a completely new auditory exploration puzzle game that entirely eliminates visual information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing players can rely on is their own sense of hearing. You must accurately perceive the direction and distance of the various sounds you hear around you, drawing a map of the labyrinth in your 