85f7cf52a725d3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756546108","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927440/cbbbe3525567cde6c3de514fe185f7cf52a725d3/ss_cbbbe3525567cde6c3de514fe185f7cf52a725d3.600x338.jpg?t=1756546108"}],"short_description":"An innovative audio-based puzzle, Echo Maze. Sight is useless. Your only guide is the sound around you. In total darkness, pinpoint your location by the sounds of scattered gimmicks and evade deadly traps. Is every sound a hint, or an invitation to death? A 3D audio survival.","steam_appid":3927440,"support_info":{"email":" soliloqu-you@outlook.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}